The company introduced positive action measures to ensure that opportunities are made known to underrepresented groups, and provided training to enable members of those groups to compete on equal terms for the opportunities available.
All individuals who sit on recruitment and selection panels receive antidiscriminatory training, and one personnel representative is present at all interviews.
The company equal opportunity policy states, amongst other things that a serious incident of racial harassment can result in summary dismissal for gross misconduct.
