PORTUGAL - The EXPO 98 Social Agreement was signed by the parties involved in this major civil engineering project in Lisbon.
Amongst other things the measures include:
A system to prevent the use of 'illegal' work. In order to enter the Expo 98 site a card has to be presented which is issued only to workers who have proved that they are legally resident in the country and are registered with the social security.
Measures to promote safety, hygiene and health at work.
